  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint:\r\nIf $P(x)=a x^{2}+b x+c, Q(x)=-a x^{2}+d x+c$\r\n$\\mathrm{D}_{1}=\\mathrm{b}^{2}-4 \\mathrm{ac}$\r\n$\\mathrm{D}_{2}=\\mathrm{d}^{2}+4 \\mathrm{ac}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{D}_{1}+\\mathrm{D}_{2}>0$\r\nAtleast two real roots.",
